              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Entities and Attributes",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Entity== = thing you store facts about (Student)",
                "==Entity set== = all such things; {blue:rectangle} in ER, rows in a table"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Attribute",
                "Example"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Simple vs **composite**",
                  "`name` → first, last"
                ],
                [
                  "**Multivalued**",
                  "`phones`"
                ],
                [
                  "{purple:Derived}",
                  "`age` from `dob`"
                ],
                [
                  "Stored",
                  "`dob`"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Weak Entities and Relationships",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Weak entity==: no key of its own",
                "Depends on an owner via the {orange:identifying relationship}",
                "Key = ==owner key + partial key== (Dependent of Employee)",
                "==Relationship== links entities (Student enrolls in Course)",
                "Relationships can carry attributes: `grade` on enrolls"
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. ER to Tables",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Entity",
                    "sub": "→ table",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Multivalued attr",
                    "sub": "→ separate table",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "M:N relationship",
                    "sub": "→ junction table",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "sql",
              "lines": [
                "CREATE TABLE enrolls (",
                "  student_id INT REFERENCES student,",
                "  course_id INT REFERENCES course,",
                "  grade CHAR(1),",
                "  PRIMARY KEY (student_id, course_id));"
              ],
              "note": "junction: both FKs, plus the relationship attribute"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Interview Point",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Why can't Dependent stand alone?** No own key; needs Employee key + partial key",
                "**How is M:N stored?** Junction table with both FKs; `grade` lives there"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
